# NVQ 1-3: Youth Training(A), Key Skills(B), Basic Skills(C), Wales Entry(D), Apprenticeship(E), RSA/OCR(F), City Guilds(G), GNVQ/GSVQ(H), NVQ L1-2(I), BTEC/BEC(M), SCOTVEC(N), Other(O)
